## 4. Data Sources, Licensing & Trust

| Data | Source | How it is used |
|---|---|---|
| School list, location, types, Google rating | Google Places API | Imported; rating shown as "Google 4.6 ★ (212)" |
| Drive times | Google Routes API | Computed on request; nothing stored but a daily count |
| Board, levels, admissions, facilities, achievements | The school's own website | Suggested by the reader, accepted by an admin, shown with the page it came from |
| CBSE affiliation | CBSE public record (SARAS) | Confirms a number the school states |
| Photos | The school (with permission) or Wikimedia Commons | Commons photos always show author and licence |
| Fees, the school day, anything a school edits | The school's staff | Live, logged, undoable |
| Reviews | Parents | Moderated before publishing |
| Applications | The family | Read only by that family, that school and a Kidscover admin |

