## 5. Privacy & Security

- The parent's location is never stored; enquiries collect no child data; reviews are anonymous; an application is
  read only by the family, the school it names and a Kidscover admin.
- Row level security on every table; parents read only visible schools and their own data; writes to sensitive data go
  through database functions that check who is asking; signed-out visitors cannot call any of them.
- No secret keys in the app, the portal or the repositories; edge functions act as the signed-in person except for the
  few that must not, and those are closed to everyone but the service role.
- Every school-profile change is logged and undoable.
- Notifications carry no message text; a locked screen is not a private place.

