## 7. Quality

Every feature ships with automated tests:
- the database rules against an in-memory Postgres;
- the edge functions against stand-in web pages and databases;
- the app and portal screens in a simulated browser;
- the language packs against English, for missing words, lost `{placeholders}` and lines left untranslated.

"Mutation testing" then breaks the code on purpose, hundreds of ways, to prove the tests notice. The rare breakages
the tests don't catch are either shown to change nothing or given a new test.

