## 9. Roadmap (next phase)

1. Google, Microsoft and phone (OTP) sign-in; a profile picture; dark mode.
2. A native speaker's read of each of the 31 languages before a public launch.
3. Fees from each school's own fee page, read the way boards and facilities are read today.
4. The app in the Play Store: a production build, a privacy policy, Google's review. An iOS build needs an Apple
   developer account.
5. The reader in more languages (Marathi and Hindi facilities and achievements), and classes 11-12 as their own level.
6. Enrolment size and how long a school has been established, as facts and as filters.
7. A location fallback order (GPS > address book > last session > ask).
8. An independent penetration test before real families use it (see SECURITY.md).

---

## 10. Out of Scope for Now

- AI sentiment analysis of social media (Reddit and other unstructured sources); reviews stay first-party and moderated.
- Payment gateway for admission fees.
- Paid or copyrighted photo sources (e.g. Google Maps photos), by decision.
